  '所有航路终于闭合，核心深处出现与观测站同频的脉冲。新的宇宙并非被制造出来，而是被听见后逐渐成形。你将控制台设为自动聆听，等待下一位发声者。': 'Every route closes, and a pulse matching the observatory rises from the Core. The new universe is not made; it takes shape as it is heard. You set the console to listen automatically, waiting for the next sender.',
