  '航行日志、成就与游戏设置': 'Flight log, achievements, and game settings',
  '发出的第一声没有立刻消失。它沿着舱壁向外扩散，随后带着一丝陌生的偏差返回；观测站终于拥有了一个可以追踪的方向。': 'The first call did not vanish. It spread along the hull and returned with an unfamiliar shift; at last, the observatory had a direction to follow.',
  '第一声没有立刻消失。它沿着舱壁向外扩散，随后带着一丝陌生的偏差返回；观测站终于拥有了一个可以追踪的方向。': 'The first call did not vanish. It spread along the hull and returned with an unfamiliar shift; at last, the observatory had a direction to follow.',
  '你替换了换能器中磨损的线圈，波形随即变得稳定。微小的改进没有改变宇宙，却让下一次呼喊抵达了更远的地方。': 'You replace a worn transducer coil, and the waveform steadies. The small repair does not change the universe, but it sends the next call farther.',
  '回声开始越过设备的噪声底，记录仪第一次保留住完整波形。那些数字不再只是产量，而是观测站仍在工作的证据。': 'The echoes rise above the instrument noise, and the recorder captures a complete waveform for the first time. The numbers are no longer just output; they prove the observatory is still alive.',
  '两道相近的频率碰在一起，屏幕上的波形短暂塌陷。干涉并非故障，而是声音彼此辨认时留下的第一种语言。': 'Two nearby frequencies collide and the waveform briefly collapses. Interference is no malfunction; it is the first language sounds use to recognize one another.',
  '一段恰好的间隔让回声突然明亮起来。你把这个频率记入航海图；宇宙的结构似乎可以被聆听，也可以被学习。': 'A precise interval brightens the echo. You mark the frequency on the chart; the universe can apparently be heard, and learned.',
  '第一座无人声源接入网络，自动把新的呼喊送入深空。控制台安静了一瞬，随后观测站里多出一道不属于你的节拍。': 'The first unattended source joins the network and sends a call into deep space. The console falls silent for a moment, then another rhythm appears—one that is not yours.',
  '你把暗寂导入共鸣腔，舱室的底噪第一次有了层次。这里不再只是发射信号的机器，也开始像一座能够记忆声音的家。': 'You route Silence into the resonance chamber, giving the cabin noise its first depth. This is no longer only a transmitter; it is becoming a home that remembers sound.',
  '回声链抵达阈值后，残余振幅沉入暗寂。它没有消散，而是成为下一次远行的燃料；沉默也因此拥有了重量。': 'When the echo chain reaches its threshold, the remaining amplitude sinks into Silence. It does not vanish; it fuels the next journey. Silence now has weight.',
  '第五十次回响仍保有可辨认的形状。探针沿着这条长链标记航路，你意识到深空的距离，也许只是一段尚未完成的等待。': 'The fiftieth echo still holds a recognizable shape. Probes mark a route along the chain, and you realize deep-space distance may be nothing more than unfinished waiting.',
  '所有声源终于同时在线，彼此的频率构成一张不断变化的网。此刻观测站不再独自呼喊，它拥有了自己的交响乐团。': 'Every source is online, their frequencies forming a shifting web. The observatory is no longer calling alone; it has become an orchestra.',
  '你把暗寂压缩成永久回响点，任由旧声场在星图上熄灭。重启的仪器保留了方法与记忆，下一轮将从更明亮的地方开始。': 'You compress Silence into permanent Echo Points and let the old soundscape fade from the chart. The instruments retain their method and memory; the next cycle begins brighter.',
  '第二次长明后，星图边缘出现一条此前不存在的航线。它需要更多暗寂才能点亮，但终点传来的脉冲与观测站完全同频。': 'After the second Eternal Light, a new route appears at the chart edge. It requires more Silence to illuminate, but its distant pulse matches the observatory exactly.',
  '远航信标越过内虚空，探针第一次把观测站留在身后。返航日志写着：前方没有边界，只有一段尚未被任何人听完的回声。': 'The beacon crosses the inner void, and probes leave the observatory behind for the first time. Their log reads: no boundary lies ahead, only an echo no one has finished hearing.',
  '星云里的失真波被锻造成新的结构，回声之城随之亮起第一扇窗。窗后传来的不是陌生语言，而是尚未发生的建造声。': 'Distorted nebula waves are forged into new structures, and the City of Echoes lights its first window. Beyond it is no strange language, but the sound of construction yet to come.',
  '终响沿星图反向传播，所有分散的回声在此刻汇为一个脉冲。你按下确认键，决定亲自听完那段来自宇宙尽头的回答。': 'The finale travels backward through the chart, gathering every scattered echo into one pulse. You confirm the signal and choose to hear the answer from the edge of the universe.',
  '星门将两片遥远星域折叠到同一张航图上。探针穿过门扉后发回一串新坐标；那里的星光比信号更早抵达，像在为你引路。': 'The gate folds distant regions onto one chart. Probes return new coordinates beyond it; their starlight arrives before the signal, as if to guide you.',
  '回廊把未来的波形送回现在，观测站的旧记录因此多出一条从未发生过的注释。你终于明白，时间也能成为回声往返的介质。': 'The corridor sends future waveforms into the present, adding a note to the observatory logs for an event that never happened. Time itself can carry an echo.',
  '最后一条航路闭合，万象核心发出与初次呼喊相同的脉冲。新宇宙由此开始成形；远征完成了，但聆听和发声都不会停止。': 'The final route closes, and the Worldheart Core emits the pulse of the first call. A new universe takes shape; the expedition ends, but listening and calling do not.',
  '深空遗物在掌心留下温热的振动，它记得一段早于星图的航行。你把它接入主机，让那份记忆继续参与下一次远征。': 'A deep-space relic leaves a warm vibration in your palm. It remembers a voyage older than the chart. You connect it to the core so its memory can guide the next expedition.',
  '幽灵信标再次出现，这回它在观测站呼叫之前先亮了起来。信号记录里多出一个陌生坐标，像是对方也在等待你的回应。': 'The Ghost Beacon appears again, lighting before the observatory calls. A strange coordinate enters the log, as if the signal is waiting for your reply.',
  '长链回声在星图上连成一条古老航路。探针识别出其中的节拍与观测站一致，仿佛很久以前就有人替你留下了路标。': 'Long echoes connect into an ancient route. Probes recognize the observatory’s rhythm in its markers, as if someone left them for you long ago.',
  '星云中的多重频率终于合成稳定和弦。那首合唱没有歌词，却精准复现了你第一次发声时的呼吸节奏。': 'The nebula’s many frequencies form a stable chord. The choir has no words, yet it reproduces the breathing rhythm of your first call.',
  '原初回声完整返回，末尾的节拍清楚得无法再归因于噪声。你没有收到答案，却第一次确信自己的声音曾被听见。': 'The Origin Echo returns intact, its final beat too clear to dismiss as noise. You have no answer, but for the first time you know your call was heard.',
